<section class="cs-spacing">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:60px;">
    <div class="row"><div class="col-lg-10 offset-lg-1">
      <h2 class="cs-font_36 text-center mb-5">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <h3 class="cs-font_20" style="margin-top:32px;font-weight:600;">What is SEO in simple terms?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#ddd;">SEO is the practice of improving a website so search engines like Google and Bing rank it higher in their unpaid (organic) results. It combines technical health, helpful content, and trust signals such as backlinks. Unlike paid ads, organic visitors don&#039;t cost per click, so traffic compounds over time.</p>
      <h3 class="cs-font_20" style="margin-top:32px;font-weight:600;">How long does SEO take to work?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#ddd;">Most sites see meaningful movement in roughly 3 to 6 months, with stronger results often building over 6 to 12 months. Timelines depend on competition, your site&#039;s current authority, content quality, and how technically sound the site is. SEO is a compounding investment, not an overnight switch.</p>
      <h3 class="cs-font_20" style="margin-top:32px;font-weight:600;">Is SEO worth it for a small business?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#ddd;">For many small businesses, yes. Organic search reaches people actively looking for what you offer, and once you rank, each visit costs nothing per click. Local SEO is especially valuable for service and brick-and-mortar businesses. It pairs well with paid ads while you build long-term momentum.</p>
      <h3 class="cs-font_20" style="margin-top:32px;font-weight:600;">SEO vs paid ads: which is better?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#ddd;">They solve different problems. Paid ads deliver traffic immediately but stop the moment you stop paying. SEO takes months to build but produces durable, free traffic that compounds. Most growing businesses use both, ads for quick wins and testing, SEO for sustainable, lower-cost visibility over time.</p>
      <h3 class="cs-font_20" style="margin-top:32px;font-weight:600;">How much does SEO cost at Apex Marketings?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#ddd;">Apex Marketings is a Rawalpindi-based agency serving clients in Pakistan, the US, UK, and UAE. Published SEO pricing starts from USD 800 per month. Final scope depends on your goals, competition, and site size. You can book a free 30-minute consultation to discuss what fits your business.</p>
